"other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>The Automobile Association</collab></person-group><article-title>The AA schedule of motoring costs</article-title><year>2005</year><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.theaa.com/motoring_advice/motoring_costs.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hay</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name><name><surname>Heron</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ness</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The prevalence of symptoms and consultations in pre-school children in the Avon Longitudinal Study of Parents and Children (ALSPAC): a prospective cohort study</article-title><source>Fam Pract</source><year>2005</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>367</fpage><lpage>374</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15897210</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/fampra/cmi035</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Office for National Statistics</collab></person-group><article-title>Population estimates for the UK</article-title><year>2006</year><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.statistics.gov.uk"/></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Butler</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Robling</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Prout</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hood</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinnersley</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Management of suspected acute viral upper respiratory tract infection in children with intranasal sodium cromoglicate: a randomised controlled trial</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2002</year><volume>359</volum